      "members": [
        "MARK"
      ],
      "original": "Look around 둘러봐도 온통 짙은 푸른빛",
      "romanization": "look around dulleobwado ontong jiteun pureunbit",
      "english": "Even when I look around it's all dark blue"
    },
    {
      "start": 16.28,
      "end": 19.22,
      "members": [
        "MARK"
      ],
      "original": "까만 밤 마치 깊은 물에 잠수한 듯이",
      "romanization": "kkaman bam machi gipeun mure jamsuhan deusi",
      "english": "In this jet-black night it's like I submerged deep in the water"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.38,
      "end": 22.48,
      "members": [
        "MARK"
      ],
      "original": "먹먹함 속에 너의 목소리만 뚜렷해",
